# SvelteKit frontend

- Svelte 5 runes only (`$state`, `$derived`, `$effect`, `$props`). No new stores.
- Client-side loading only — no `+page.server.ts`.
- Call `$lib/api/client.ts` helpers; add types in `$lib/api/types.ts`. Never raw `fetch` in pages.
- Format money and fiscal months with `$lib/utils/format.ts`.
- Reuse `BoletoLikePage` for boleto-like domains. Use `$lib/components/ui/` + sonner toasts.
- Upload UX is drop → parse-preview → confirm → save. Dark theme tokens from `app.css`.
